      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Objectionable content and abusive behavior are not tolerated. Do not post pornography, exploitation, threats, hateful abuse, harassment, or illegal material. NSFW posts are unavailable in this iOS app.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 26,
          "startingLine": 225
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Report posts or users without a token or credit requirement. Blocking immediately hides their content and notifies the iOS operator. The operator reviews reports and acts on violations within 24 hours, removing content and suspending responsible users in the official iOS app. These actions do not delete data or accounts from the decentralized TAGGR network.",
